reviewqueue Plugin for DokuWiki

Holds back page and media changes from configured users or groups in a review
queue instead of publishing them immediately. Everyone else keeps saving
directly. Intended for wikis where an AI agent has its own account, but the
plugin itself is user-scoped, not AI-specific.

If you install this plugin manually, make sure it is installed in
lib/plugins/reviewqueue/ - if the folder is called different it
will not work!

Please refer to https://www.dokuwiki.org/plugins for additional info
on how to install plugins in DokuWiki.

Target version: DokuWiki 2024-02-06b "Kaos". Newer releases are untested.

Full documentation lives in the source repository this plugin was built
from: INSTALL.md for setup, docs/usage.md for day-to-day operation.

